<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs off $1.00-1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs off $1.00-1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $1.00 to $1.50 lower. Demand and supplies were light to moderate. Top $51.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  49.50-51.00, few 51.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  44.00-49.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  40.00-44.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 40.00-42.50</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs. 47.00-49.00, few over 600 lbs.</p>
<p>50.00-52.00</p>
</text>
